# A trailer closes the frame it follows.  After a frame that `end:` already closed, P0 leaves a
# second trailer an ordinary column-0 item (FABLE-GROKBOT-P0-CLOSED-FRAME-TRAILER-20260923-114);
# it is still not a statement of the entry, and is refused by name.
fn: m () int
    return: 1
end: m
end: m
return: 0
